- op: discuss  # 5450
  at: '2026-07-16T04:12:38Z'  # 5450
  by: agent  # 5450
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 5450
  clock: 6  # 5450
  nonce: '5450'  # 5450
  message: "REPRODUCES on the cohort (DEEP bakeoff deep-20260623-134237 cohort-001 iter-004) despite status=done — flagging for re-verification (closure-evidence discipline: do not close on non-repro, and this IS reproducing). The slice/compact seed selection still picks trivial build-wrappers / vendored / test code over real API surfaces: spring-petclinic seeds slice.0/1 from mvnw/gradlew (rank_score 0.98) over HTTP controllers (0.725, conf 0.95) — a rank-score INVERSION; pretix picks vendored JS (pdf.worker.js/d3/vue.js) as slice+rslice seeds; express's #1 symbol is a test-file example callback createApp (in=202). This is HIGH impact — it's the dominant driver of the LOW_AVG_SLICE_NODES WARNs AND the WI-zulij compact-not-centrality no_move. Recommend re-open + re-prioritize (P4->P2?). Per-repo evidence in reflect/cohort-001/iter-004/{spring-petclinic,pretix,express}.assessment.yaml."  # 5450
